silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.03_replication_and_convergence.concrete_anchor.node1" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The Replica_i_StoragePacket is Replica R_i is a typed copy of StoragePacket_Mittens held at node i in the distributed system. It participates in gossip merge. It is one source in the replication convergence diagram. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'R_i (replica i of StoragePacket_Mittens)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node2 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.03_replication_and_convergence.concrete_anchor.node2" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MergedReplica_i_j is R_i join R_j is the merged replica produced by the gossip join operation. It is the colimit in the sub-diagram of {R_i, R_j, morphisms}. It is still a REPLICA — not the governed individual Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'R_i join R_j (merged replica)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node3 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.02_factored_storage_topology.sections.03_replication_and_convergence.concrete_anchor.node3" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_02_factored_storage_topology_sections_03_replication_and_convergence_concrete_anchor_node3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensAboveReplicaLattice is Mittens is the colimit apex of D_Mittens — above the replica lattice. The replicas are all ABOUT Mittens; they converge toward a consistent view of Mittens but never become Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens (the apex, above the replica lattice)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
